usage: native_delivery_live_benchmark.py [-h]
                                         {run,inspect,recover,cleanup} ...

Opt-in real-row harness. No service discovery occurs on import/help/absence.

positional arguments:
  {run,inspect,recover,cleanup}
    run                 Write one run envelope; no approval writes SKIP
                        without loading the factory.
    inspect             Verify retained evidence and list eligible trial count
                        without services.
    recover             Reattach an existing owned invocation; never provision
                        new objects.
    cleanup             Reattach an existing owned invocation; never provision
                        new objects.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
